{
  "name": "snapshot-and-join-request",
  "description": "State snapshot: nonce (24) || XChaCha20-Poly1305(state key, nonce, aad = empty, snapshot) (design B.2). Join request: join_key = HKDF-Expand(invite_secret, \"join\", 32), then nonce (24) || XChaCha20-Poly1305(join_key, nonce, aad = empty, be16(len) || request || zero padding), padded inside the AEAD so the post is exactly the smallest mailbox size class that fits (1, 4, 8 or 32 KiB) (design D; padding is a decision). `nonce` is the randomness consumed. Vectors with an `error` open `sealed` and must fail.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "state-snapshot",
      "inputs": {
        "state_key": "e0946ff1df77d180dcab9093b880288f7ce48373fd122034c6296e7fd8d67275",
        "nonce": "0db23730ca29f4b35589fdab835a2bf64fa3f1ad015d07f4",
        "snapshot": ""
      },
      "expected": {
        "sealed": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "join-request",
      "inputs": {
        "invite_secret": "1cb61adcb3cf60d763142dd52019ec09e27cb824f03b188287f3aa2ff285935c",
        "nonce": "2ce0f112389f3cf6e8bc91d548522de9b034a1a78e5c9c88",
        "request": "65a3ff8aeb6764b31daa830d9b1f64a68edd9dca24b08bd59a33fb9abd27816fb4dda60ff0585267580fc08e0a8ea0125c8c5b25bccc1d7236f531b38b7421e01d576462cf0d212b812ce1419753827ef8a1a12aeca0d393c4ce830ebccb43a706a6b904fe4b5fc28110e1299510f80d7d63335febf41904"
      },
      "expected": {
        "join_key": "c7d0bae84090bcfca425830314bcb627a1f82217d12aa8882b9c0b420ac45481",
        "sealed": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "truncated-join-request-does-not-open",
      "inputs": {
        "invite_secret": "1cb61adcb3cf60d763142dd52019ec09e27cb824f03b188287f3aa2ff285935c",
        "sealed": "2ce0f112389f3cf6e8bc91d548522de9b034a1a78e5c9c"
      },
      "expected": {
